{"id":"661723","name":"酱油青椒","author":"宸·羽","authorId":"7796837","desc":"","cover":"images/661723/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"青椒","amount":"750g"},{"name":"小米椒","amount":"适量"},{"name":"大蒜","amount":"4头"}],"sub":[{"name":"八角粒","amount":"5g"},{"name":"香叶","amount":"3片"},{"name":"花椒","amount":"2g"},{"name":"桂皮","amount":"2g"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"这种小青椒的口感微辣，适合做泡椒，清洗干净后晾干水分。","img":"images/661723/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"准备小米椒和蒜米。","img":"images/661723/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"适量的大料。","img":"images/661723/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"锅里倒入酱油和水，放入洗干净的大料，大火煮开后转小火煮15-20分钟。","img":"images/661723/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"煮好后加入冰糖化开。","img":"images/661723/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"关火，放入鸡精提鲜。","img":"images/661723/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放一旁晾凉，使用时捞去料渣。","img":"images/661723/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"青椒切开。","img":"images/661723/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"蒜和小米椒切片。","img":"images/661723/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"把青红椒放入盆内，加适量盐杀水，去除青辣的味道。","img":"images/661723/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"杀好水的青椒已软化。","img":"images/661723/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"放入蒜片。","img":"images/661723/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"倒入晾凉酱汁。","img":"images/661723/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"充分搅拌均匀。","img":"images/661723/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"放入容器内。","img":"images/661723/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"表面加入高度米酒，不易坏。","img":"images/661723/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"放入冰箱保存，三天后可食用。","img":"images/661723/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"成品。餐前小菜，开胃解腻。","img":"images/661723/step_18.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：其他\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}